     5583             .
     5584             run export-deleted-docs in this-procedure (
     5585                   input v-doc-code
     5586                 , input buf_c-trn-doc.corr-user-db-num
     5587                 , input buf_c-trn-doc.chip-num
     5588             ) no-error.
     5589             if error-status :error
